{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2mpwl1xf","type":"work","title":"唐詩三百首","authors":[{"name":"孫洙","role":"編","dynasty":"清","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bnnc"}],"description":{"text":"清乾隆二十八年（1763年）孫洙（蘅塘退士）與夫人徐蘭英編選，收錄唐代77位詩人約311首詩歌，按體裁分類編排（五言古詩、七言古詩、樂府、五言律詩、七言律詩、五言絕句、七言絕句）。為流傳最廣的唐詩選本。","sources":[]},"resources":[{"id":"wikisource","name":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/%E5%94%90%E8%A9%A9%E4%B8%89%E7%99%BE%E9%A6%96","types":["text"]},{"id":"wikipedia","name":"維基百科","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%94%90%E8%A9%A9%E4%B8%89%E7%99%BE%E9%A6%96","types":["text"]}],"updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:40:18+00:00","_has_collated":true,"_has_text":true,"period":"qing","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「清」","dynasty":"清","dynasty_basis":"qing_round1:period=qing 且非通用作者 dynasty 唯一为「清」","revision":"1.0.0","revised_at":"2026-08-25","has_collated":true,"has_text":true,"_path":"Work/1/x/f/d59f2mpwl1xf-唐詩三百首.json","_isDraft":false}